Package: smop
Type: Package
Title: Level-Set Method for Sparse Optimization (BMOP) - C++ Core with R Interface
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("smop", "developers", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "dev@example.invalid")
Description: Solves the Basis-Pursuit / Lasso with a level-set constraint
    min ||x||_1 s.t. ||A x - b||_2 <= delta, using the level-set method of
    Li, Sun & Yuan with adaptive sieving and smoothing-Newton subproblems.
    The numerical core is C++ (header-only, Eigen); this package provides
    the R interface via Rcpp.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports: Rcpp (>= 1.0.0)
LinkingTo: Rcpp
SystemRequirements: C++17, Eigen (header-only, bundled under third_party/)
NeedsCompilation: yes
